A.Vi=new B.it("Scheduling Lessons","Calendar","To schedule a lesson, go to the Training Calendar, click on a session date, and then click an EMPTY slot in the matrix. You can then select a lesson from the library, assign an instructor, and set a location.")
A.Vl=new B.it("Deconfliction","Planning","The tool automatically checks for instructor and location conflicts. If an instructor is already assigned to a period in another phase, they will be marked as (IN USE) in the dropdown. An alert icon will also appear in the matrix if a conflict exists.")
A.Vm=new B.it("Switching Themes","Settings","You can switch between Light, Dark, Sea, and System themes using the icons in the Dashboard header. The Sea theme is a special high-contrast dark mode with Navy and Gold accents.")
A.Vj=new B.it("Training Phases","General","The tool supports four training phases. Each phase has its own mandatory and complementary lessons. The progress for each phase is tracked independently.")
A.Vn=new B.it("Smart Auto-Plan (Experimental)","Planning","NOTE: This feature is currently experimental. The Auto-Plan tool distributes remaining Mandatory Fundamental lessons across empty slots using a round-robin algorithm. We recommend reviewing the results carefully as the logic is still being refined.")
A.Vk=new B.it("Calendar View Modes","Calendar","You can now switch between ACADEMIC (Sep-Jun) and FULL YEAR (Jan-Dec) modes using the toggle in the calendar header. This is useful for planning summer training or specialized courses outside the normal school year.")
A.Vp=new B.it("Backup & Restore","Data",'You can download a full backup of your training data from the Dashboard. On the web, this will trigger a direct download of a .json file. To restore, simply upload that same file using the "Import" tool.')
A.Vo=new B.it("Resetting the Schedule","Calendar",'If you want to start fresh or re-run the Auto-Plan, use the "Clear All Lessons" tool in the Auto-Plan menu. This wipes all planned periods while keeping your session dates and parade nights intact.')
